.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgona-dev-journal-help 1  "dalgona-dev-journal-help " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help \- Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona dev journal help\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help\-replay(1)
Fold a journal and print the recovered state.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help\-diff(1)
Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help\-torn(1)
Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help\-sidecar(1)
List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
